  "body": "URLs like https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/branch-snapshots/move-readable-stream/ should get a popover explaining that this is a branch and is not part of the living standard.\n\nURLs like https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/fa8bcc0318e5f62d099d761a651cd10e334308b4/ should have a popover explaining they are commit snapshots and likely not up-to-date and should not be used by implementers or developers except as reference to the past.\n",
